#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:5 1368025fe90c496faf2d3f66b82e3472
msgid "RTL Mode"
msgstr "RTL模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:7 bfa9c888a6ce406380c5604853811263
msgid ""
"RTL mode (Return To Launch mode) navigates Copter from its current position "
"to hover above the home position. The behavior of RTL mode can be controlled"
" by several adjustable parameters. This page describes how to use and "
"customize RTL mode."
msgstr ""
"RTL模式（返回起飞点模式）将飞行器从当前位置导航回起飞点上方悬停。RTL模式的行为可通过多个可调参数进行控制。本页面介绍如何使用和自定义RTL模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:13 39dba11cd82d4452ab56912f3aa31c46
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:15 906cbefac24e43faa2729bfcb1e2b6b4
msgid ""
"When RTL mode is selected, the copter will return to the home location, or "
"if rally points have been setup, the closet rally point."
msgstr "选择RTL模式后，飞行器将返回Home位置，或如果已设置集结点，则返回最近的集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:17 ef72435dbee44ef5877ec274be95f16d
msgid ""
"The copter will first rise a minimum of :ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>` "
"or to  :ref:`RTL_ALT <RTL_ALT>`, whichever is higher, before returning home."
"  The default value for :ref:`RTL_ALT <RTL_ALT>` is 15m. Under no "
"circumstances will this altitude be below 30cm."
msgstr ""
"飞行器将首先爬升至至少 :ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>` 或 :ref:`RTL_ALT <RTL_ALT>` "
"中较高的高度，然后再返回Home。:ref:`RTL_ALT <RTL_ALT>` 的默认值为15米。此高度在任何情况下均不会低于30厘米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:19 a6b9f7fac5084b64a7768877ae34ba9d
msgid ""
"The altitude reference frame is set by either the rally point, if proceeding"
" to one of those, or by :ref:`RTL_ALT_TYPE<RTL_ALT_TYPE>` to select relative"
" to HOME, or Terrain. If :ref:`WPNAV_RFND_USE<WPNAV_RFND_USE>` = 1 and "
"Terrain is selected, then rangefinder will be used."
msgstr ""
"高度参考系由集结点（如果前往集结点）或 :ref:`RTL_ALT_TYPE<RTL_ALT_TYPE>` 设置，可选择相对于Home或地形。如果 "
":ref:`WPNAV_RFND_USE<WPNAV_RFND_USE>` = 1 且选择了地形，则将使用测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:24 eded04c008584e5ea3d26d1372b11986
msgid ""
"If RTL is entered close to its return point, the altitude Copter climbs to "
"may be limited to avoid unneeded climbs and descents. The "
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>` parameter determines the slope of an "
"inverted cone centered on the return point. This reduces the above return "
"altitude according to: distance from return point * "
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`. So if the mode is entered 10m from "
"the return point, using the default slope of \"3\", then the altitude rise "
"would be limited to 30m before returning. It may be less depending on the "
"other parameters, but not higher. If the slope were set to \"0.5\", then the"
" initial climb would be no higher than 5m altitude before proceeding to the "
"return point. A value of \"0\" disables this limit. \"0.5\" is the minimum "
"slope. Again, 2m is the minimum return altitude."
msgstr ""
"如果在距返航点较近处进入RTL，为避免不必要的爬升和下降，飞行器爬升的高度可能受到限制。:ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`"
" 参数定义了以返航点为中心的倒锥斜率。该参数根据与返航点的距离乘以 :ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>` "
"来限制上述返航高度。例如，若在距返航点10米处进入该模式，默认斜率为\"3\"，则高度爬升最多限制为30米再返回。实际高度可能因其他参数而更低，但不会更高。若斜率设为\"0.5\"，则前往返航点前的初始爬升高度不超过5米。值\"0\"禁用此限制，\"0.5\"为最小斜率。同样，最小返航高度为2米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:26 226482b45689472b92c1a4af124a45fb
msgid ""
"RTL mode requires a reliable position estimate to work properly, most "
"commonly provided by GPS and compass. Default prearm checks will ensure a 3D"
" GPS lock with sufficient HDOP is acquired and your mag is working as "
"expected prior to arming. When using non-default arming checks, make sure "
"you do have a sufficient GPS lock and / or a reliable position estimate for "
"RTL to perform as expected."
msgstr ""
"RTL模式需要可靠的位置估计才能正常工作，通常由GPS和罗盘提供。默认预解锁检查将确保在解锁前已获取HDOP足够的3D "
"GPS锁定，且罗盘工作正常。使用非默认解锁检查时，请确保具有足够的GPS锁定和/或可靠的位置估计，以便RTL按预期执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:29 35711373018b4e45b429375f4d5b1980
msgid ""
"RTL will command the copter to return to the home position, meaning that it "
"will return to the location where it was armed. Therefore, the home position"
" is always supposed to be your copter's actual GPS takeoff location, "
"unobstructed and away from people. For Copter if you get GPS lock and then "
"ARM your copter, the home position is the location the copter was in when it"
" was armed. This means if you execute an RTL in Copter, it will return to "
"the location where it was armed."
msgstr ""
"RTL将命令飞行器返回Home位置，即返回解锁时所在的位置。因此，Home位置应始终是飞行器实际的GPS起飞位置，且无遮挡、远离人群。对于Copter，如果已获得GPS锁定后解锁，Home位置即为解锁时飞行器所在位置。这意味着在Copter中执行RTL时，飞行器将返回解锁时所在的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:39 185af19c902742deaf832daefa3cacfc
msgid ""
"In RTL mode the autopilot uses a barometer which measures air pressure as "
"the primary means for determining altitude (\"Pressure Altitude\") and if "
"the air pressure is changing in your flight area, the copter will follow the"
" air pressure change rather than actual altitude (unless you are within 20 "
"feet of the ground and have SONAR installed and enabled)."
msgstr ""
"在RTL模式下，飞控主要使用气压计（测量气压）来确定高度（\"气压高度\"）。如果您飞行区域的气压发生变化，飞行器将跟随气压变化而非实际高度飞行（除非您在距地面20英尺以内且已安装并启用声呐）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:47 bf97e16e233443e7813c3fc876cd78f0
msgid "Options (User Adjustable Parameters)"
msgstr "选项（用户可调参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:49 18fba5fef0da4538b89548cee885ed6a
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_ALT <RTL_ALT>`: The minimum altitude the copter will move to "
"before returning to launch."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_ALT <RTL_ALT>`：飞行器返回起飞点前爬升到的最低高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:52 6f87a46d8ee74606aa269349d82a80e4
msgid "Set to zero to return at the current altitude."
msgstr "设为零则以当前高度返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:53 c7d8d5e60d2d42b981276c9ad1f2b6b9
msgid "The return altitude can be set from 1 to 8000 centimeters."
msgstr "返回高度可设置为1至8000厘米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:54 5a0cfbc7c20b42e194e9665b4d079574
msgid "The default return altitude Default is 15 meters (1500)"
msgstr "默认返回高度为15米（1500）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:56 4afb48a01329461482097895ce601ba0
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_ALT_FINAL <RTL_ALT_FINAL>`: The altitude the copter will move to "
"at the final stage of \"Returning to Launch\" or after completing a Mission."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_ALT_FINAL <RTL_ALT_FINAL>`：飞行器在\"返回起飞点\"最终阶段或完成任务后移动到的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:60 89e68e76c1ac4eaab6d6a993cb4a4ec7
msgid "Set to zero to automatically land the copter."
msgstr "设为零则自动降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:61 d4b275b657aa4d2a83233070fc5f969a
msgid "The final return altitude may be adjusted from 0 to 1000 centimeters."
msgstr "最终返回高度可在0至1000厘米之间调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:64 6fe6041f24e3479ba2760cd68e83a09c
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_LOIT_TIME <RTL_LOIT_TIME>`: Time in milliseconds to hover/pause "
"above the \"Home\" position before beginning final descent."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_LOIT_TIME <RTL_LOIT_TIME>`：在开始最终下降之前，在\"Home\"位置上方悬停/暂停的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:68 c060ffa9b2614e4381d775a18602f48c
msgid "The \"Loiter\" time may be adjusted from 0 to 60,000 milliseconds."
msgstr "\"悬停\"时间可在0至60,000毫秒之间调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:70 47308f94e4fa4dc999ee4bbd6a4d0a24
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR <WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR>`: Sets how the autopilot controls "
"the \"Yaw\" during Missions and RTL."
msgstr ":ref:`WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR <WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR>`：设置飞控在任务和RTL期间如何控制\"偏航\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:73 12c18215c72d4b0cbd519d31944aa346
msgid "0 = Never change Yaw."
msgstr "0 = 从不改变偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:74 ab661e19370a451d93e8721a8362bd6b
msgid "1 = Face Next Waypoint including facing home during RTL."
msgstr "1 = 朝向下一个航点，包括RTL时朝向Home。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:75 88a8b2870eff4a44b92c98e7044f6cf5
msgid ""
"2 = Face Next Waypoint except for RTL (i.e. during RTL vehicle will remain "
"pointed at its last heading)"
msgstr "2 = 朝向下一个航点，但RTL时除外（即RTL期间飞行器将保持最后的航向）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:78 596226df047c48f88a8e5c7e7ff5fbd4
msgid ""
":ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>`: The descent speed for the final stage of "
"landing in centimeters per second."
msgstr ":ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>`：降落最终阶段的下降速度，单位为厘米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:82 040282debe2c46e18dda78dbce4419f8
msgid "The landing speed is adjustable from 20 to 200 centimeters per second."
msgstr "降落速度可在20至200厘米/秒之间调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:85 fb541fecb1f0436ca25b873e36b3c5b2
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN <RTL_CLIMB_MIN>`: The vehicle will climb at least this "
"many meters at the first stage of the RTL.  By default this value is zero."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN <RTL_CLIMB_MIN>`：飞行器在RTL第一阶段至少爬升的米数。默认值为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:89 3498bc4f9e7742a79e864cb2430cb0b3
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>`: The horizontal speed (in cm/s) at which the "
"vehicle will return to home.  By default this value is zero meaning it will "
"use :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED <WPNAV_SPEED>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>`：飞行器返回Home的水平速度（厘米/秒）。默认值为零，即使用 "
":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED <WPNAV_SPEED>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:94 bee5ac6e97644263af0ce0b4da7c7207
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE <RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`: Defines the slope of an inverted "
"cone above home which is used to limit the amount the vehicle climbs when "
"RTL-ing from close to home. Low values lead to a wide cone meaning the "
"vehicle will climb less, High values will lead to the vehicle climbing more."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE "
"<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`：定义Home上方倒锥的斜率，用于限制从近处RTL时的爬升量。低值导致锥体较宽（爬升较少），高值导致爬升较多。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:101 3e36499556fc4a3387c5c5fe605633f3
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:103 4542193f78084b7691738e60380eaeaf
msgid "Other navigation settings also have an influence over RTL mode:"
msgstr "其他导航设置也会影响RTL模式："

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:105 913c0ead09394d02a7f9715864c3bfc3
msgid ":ref:`WPNAV_ACCEL <WPNAV_ACCEL>`"
msgstr ":ref:`WPNAV_ACCEL <WPNAV_ACCEL>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:106 c955ecec182b4315baafa6de35f0839b
msgid ":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_DN <WPNAV_SPEED_DN>`"
msgstr ":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_DN <WPNAV_SPEED_DN>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:107 fc4b7e1d9cf14ff28b72600593b36761
msgid ":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_UP <WPNAV_SPEED_UP>`"
msgstr ":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_UP <WPNAV_SPEED_UP>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:109 46dcb0065bb642f3a0c4e1fce12e58e3
msgid ""
"To use RTL, GPS lock needs to be achieved (Blue GPS LED and Blue APM LED on "
"solid not blinking) before arming and takeoff to establish the home or "
"launch position."
msgstr "使用RTL前，需要在解锁和起飞前获得GPS锁定（GPS蓝色LED和APM蓝色LED常亮不闪），以建立Home或起飞位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:112 761f9d2d6b634a7b9a1c435a0ac54171
msgid ""
"Landing and re-arming the copter will reset home, which is a great feature "
"for flying at airfields."
msgstr "降落并重新解锁将重置Home位置，这对在机场飞行非常实用。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:114 20bfa6c7b6e14aa0884a7263e4a0079d
msgid ""
"If you get lock for the first time while flying, your home will be set at "
"the location of lock."
msgstr "如果您在飞行中首次获得GPS锁定，Home将设置在锁定时的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:116 70859ac0b1ff43a69e2f68087a3aec51
msgid ""
"If you set the ``RTL_ALT`` to a number at other than 0 it will go to and "
"maintain that altitude while returning."
msgstr "如果将``RTL_ALT``设置为非0值，飞行器将前往并保持该高度返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:118 a07ca8f019224355b22f4ba3e2517b04
msgid ""
"RTL uses :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED <WPNAV_SPEED>` to determine how fast it travels."
msgstr "RTL使用 :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED <WPNAV_SPEED>` 来确定飞行速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:119 017868bbb8194ca7a1af2cf62656a2c5
msgid ""
"Once the copter arrives at the home location the copter will pause for "
"``RTL_LOIT_TIME`` milliseconds, timeout (AUTO_LAND), then land."
msgstr "飞行器到达Home位置后，将暂停``RTL_LOIT_TIME``毫秒，超时（AUTO_LAND）后降落。"
